SIGTERM interrupts pselect() and the loop leaves on the next iteration with ret still -1 from it:
"p11-kit server" exited with status 255 and p11-kit-server.service (systemd --user) failed at
every logout. A requested termination is a clean exit.

--- a/p11-kit/server.c
+++ b/p11-kit/server.c
@@ -605,8 +605,10 @@
 		if (need_children_cleanup)
 			cleanup_children ();

-		if (terminate)
+		if (terminate) {
+			ret = 0;
 			break;
+		}

 		FD_ZERO (&rd_set);
 		FD_SET (server->socket, &rd_set);
